% backend: none
% expect-output: /typecheck
% expect-output: /typecheck
% expect-error: typecheck
% Scenario: unsuitable operands are typecheck: a number as the source,
% a parameter of the wrong type, and a literal array, which is not a
% data-source procedure.
% Expect: /typecheck twice, then an uncaught typecheck.
{ 42 /ASCIIHexDecode filter } stopped pop $error /errorname get ==
{ (x) << /Predictor (a) >> /FlateDecode filter } stopped pop
  $error /errorname get ==
[ 1 2 ] /ASCII85Decode filter
